    the Vernusylph Goddess" once per turn. You can target 1 face-up monster your
    opponent controls; take control of it, and if you do, it becomes EARTH. During
    your opponent''s turn (Quick Effect): You can target 1 EARTH monster in your
    GY; Special Summon it.'
